Modifications made in this fork (v0.1.0):

* Added 6 new modules under source/src/:
    - utils/logger.ts        — ring-buffer diagnostic logger
    - utils/throttle.ts      — Box-Muller normal-distribution throttle
    - cache/index.ts         — IndexedDB chapter cache (session + Pin)
    - pool/index.ts          — 3-slot device pool with manual refill
    - panel/index.ts         — floating control panel + sidebar upgrade
    - panel/recovery.ts      — 5-option failure recovery dialog

* Modified existing modules:
    - main.ts                — serialized initialization
    - api/app.ts             — replaced upstream replaceDevice() with pool
    - hooks/readerHook.ts    — integrated cache lookup + Pin button injection
    - vite.config.ts         — updated @name / @description / @author metadata
    - package.json           — version 0.0.6 → 0.1.0

* Removed features (v0.1.0 slim strategy):
    - bookshelfHook, searchHook, audioPanel, download/, epub/
    - userHook (avatar menu)
    - GM_cookie permission
    - @connect domain list reduced from 9 to 3

The upstream full-feature build (v0.0.6) is preserved verbatim at
release/fanqie-assistant-v0.0.6.user.js as an emergency fallback.

